# VetBuddy Benefit Vault research ledger, federal 01 (passes, travel, MWR, education, insurance)
# Format: CAT|TITLE|GROUPS|RULE|ELIGIBLE|VALUE|URL  (see data/research/RESEARCH_LOG.md)
# Federal blocks use JUR=US. OPENED=<date> means the SRC page was read; a block with SRC=none holds rows whose
# URL was only seen in search results (page not read) and is published only as a lead for human review.
# Rows from the agency's or operator's own page (tier 1 or 3) import as SOURCE_CHECKED, the rest as UNVERIFIED; none is VERIFIED until a named reviewer checks it (G1).

