INSURANCE|Servicemembers' Group Life Insurance (SGLI)|ad,ng,rsv|sm|Most active duty members and Ready Reserve and Guard members (automatic coverage)|Group term life coverage; can extend up to two years if totally disabled at separation|PAGE
